      "content": "idk im just kinda scared to go to the er cuz the wait is always forever and its so expensive. i do get migraines sometimes and they get pretty bad, maybe this is just a really intense one? like could it just be a tension headache or something if the pain starts to settle down a little bit after an hour?",
