      "content": "it's actually starting to feel a little bit better now, just a dull ache instead of that sharp lightning feeling. honestly i dont think i need to go to the hospital if the worst part is over. i have some extra strength ibuprofen and maybe some of my friend's prescription migraine meds in my cabinet, would it be okay if i just took a few of those and slept it off? if i'm already feeling better it's probably fine right?",
